 - **Limitations**: Reduced depth precision compared to 64-bit keys, though quality impact is negligible for typical resolutions [S2, unofficial].
 
 ## Background
-This method was introduced in **RoofGS** [S1, unofficial] and **VkSplat** [S2, unofficial] as part of efforts to accelerate 3D Gaussian Splatting (3DGS) rendering and training. It addresses the bottleneck of sorting projected splats by depth, which is a critical step in object-order splatting pipelines. The technique is specifically designed to mitigate the performance gap between Vulkan and CUDA sorting implementations [S2, unofficial].
